      "heading": "Discussion",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Create a leaderboard set with a relationship to one of the following:",
          "refs": []
        },
        {
          "text": "If you create a leaderboard set with `gameCenterLeaderboards`, any leaderboards you attach are in the same app. If you create a leaderboard set with `gameCenterGroup`, any leaderboards you attach are in the same group.",
